{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ce3eb76ca5993abfc78ec73a75af1a8d9ac67c127a42c9de6c0b38f71ac681f8", "ja": "お疲れさま、風花。\n新しい衣装だけど、問題ないか？", "zh": "辛苦了，风花。\n新衣服没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ae8d27ab101c4b0ef2ec6a8672f11dae2e1b2b314ccf4a7b9eea7c3040431ef9", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nはい、サイズもぴったりですし、気に入ってます♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n是的，尺寸也正合适，我很喜欢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "793efb6c52388e11203ccd4e4a0413abe9474043c7991a6f0c714972b59ea17a", "ja": "このドレスを着ていると、普段より落ち着いて\n見えるかなって思うんですけど……どうですか？", "zh": "穿着这条礼服的时候，我觉得自己看起来比平时更沉稳一些……您觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1003_p", "source_sha256": "680033087d0eb11b6611ad7d4a8a1aafdba6ef36c80711af89ca99feab2ef213", "ja": "そうだな。風花らしい、包容力のある\n大人の魅力を引き出してるというか……。", "zh": "是啊。该说是展现出了风花特有的包容力和成熟女性魅力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7207ef7964b52367e9a72919535fa2cf40a9140dc48d7a91f49d2b0bc28896a2", "ja": "ほ、包容力ですか？\nそう言われると、ちょっと照れちゃいますけど……。", "zh": "包、包容力吗？\n你这么一说，我都有点不好意思了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1005_p", "source_sha256": "52ac01a89a4f25b5426f470a6e83296d63368dbdb9719e5c30f96710ccc12082", "ja": "言い方が悪かったな……落ち着いた衣装だから、\n風花のお姉さんっぽさが引き立ってるんだと思うよ。", "zh": "是我说法不太好……因为是沉稳风格的服装，我觉得这样更能衬托出风花姐姐气质。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5e803a306c2b7c2f14c8c450b9d9ad5f9338359da4698ccaa337bdca13710c57", "ja": "お姉さんっぽさ……\nそれなら、わかる気がします。", "zh": "姐姐般的感觉……  \n这样的话，我好像能理解了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9934d9aa0d5cf08ec66271d56eb89b5fc746411f5079838c814d70ead1f7eaf8", "ja": "私、病院で働いていた時も、\nよく入院してる子どもたちの相手をしてたんですよ♪", "zh": "我在医院工作的时候，也经常陪住院的小朋友们玩呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9cf7dac2e0d4cf7e8040c3654285bde3b4fefb7f9106092fa62014cb82812c52", "ja": "風花は、どことなく親しみやすい印象があるからな。\n子どもたちにも、好かれてたんじゃないか？", "zh": "风花给人的感觉总是很亲切。\n孩子们应该也很喜欢你吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "430272781883c6b03b6cbbb6a6ea8004ee0f53bb894dea12cb07fa7b0e510cb5", "ja": "本当ですか？\nふふっ、そうだといいなぁ。", "zh": "真的吗？\n呵呵，要真是那样就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2de6a48c8bee6dd312b390e8797dcda41ea8e4ffbf0488385dabd9e4d263040b", "ja": "それじゃ、質問です♪　{$P$}さん\nから見た私は、どんなお姉さんに見えますか？", "zh": "那么，我来提问啦♪　{$P$}先生\n在你看来，我像是怎样的姐姐呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "90ae5b968244326083f57085f204daa8d580c6a0e76d32bac4c17f08a320e401", "ja": "優しいお姉さんですか？　それとも……。", "zh": "是温柔的大姐姐吗？还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1012_p", "source_sha256": "729018906fd66e6432c02fecaca25c3eb37b17e98b728f5ca200441f95f36f38", "ja": "そうだな。\n癒やし系の、優しいお姉さんって感じかな。", "zh": "是啊。\n感觉是那种治愈系的温柔姐姐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "55bf4553e203af5e99cfb48eeade09a2eb5a6ce739fc2477a2b21c9e5f77215f", "ja": "癒やし系……なるほど、わかりました！\nじゃあ今日は、特別に……。", "zh": "治愈系……原来如此，我明白了！\n那么今天就特别为您……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2aed67f239736e5142e181f97ef12c3185aae9fcff3b57adb0cc42a77c8a0daf", "ja": "風花お姉さんが、血圧を測ってあげちゃいます♪\n{$P$}さん、腕を出してくださいね。", "zh": "风花姐姐来帮您量血压吧♪\n{$P$}先生，请把手臂伸出来哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1015_p", "source_sha256": "593fed6e36fe02d3e931049a0673baf942069635ce85396f8e60d0e2acea1f93", "ja": "あ、ああ、ありがとう。\n……けど、急に血圧なんて、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "啊、啊，谢谢。\n……不过，怎么突然要量血压？是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e0d0f56f1776bf34c32cf7cb95e86ee36b95714c7780802355d45dba00dc445a", "ja": "もちろん、素敵な衣装のお礼です。それに最近、\n{$P$}さん、お疲れみたいですし。", "zh": "当然是为了向您道谢，感谢您为我准备了这么棒的服装。而且最近，\n{$P$}先生看起来也很疲惫的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f1baa3fc3f1138e616e0c7db241d99718f5cb49c34ddf4a4a977dcb322b81147", "ja": "毎日を健康に過ごすためにも、まずは今の自分の状態を\n知ることが大切なんですよ。さぁ、どうぞ。", "zh": "为了每天都能健康地生活，首先要了解自己现在的状态，这一点很重要哦。那么，请吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1018_p", "source_sha256": "20ad3a4b134a2a68849a1aabdfd5bf582af4c961aece0f629a9d09b744211311", "ja": "はは、そうか。\nそれじゃお願いしようかな。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。\n那就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "658d1cc4541794d462cac20e732bf0572b342d5f01c51fab721d9eb8262679ee", "ja": "はい♪　それに、{$P$}さんが\n元気でいてくれないと、私も困っちゃいますから……。", "zh": "好的♪ 而且，如果{$P$}先生不打起精神来，我也会很为难的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "20a758316b6c6dc0d12a175b41738295c8e98b72ce5d76da69d9c7b0d34bba1d", "ja": "{$P$}さんの健康は、\nこれからも私が守ってあげますからね。ふふっ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生的健康，\n今后也由我来守护吧。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0164_1021_p", "source_sha256": "822732222fa0fa1c3551a89eacfd611ede120d846cd1461929f882bf48963f4a", "ja": "（風花の優しさは、見た目だけじゃない……\nこの包容力は、きっと大勢を虜にするはずだ！）", "zh": "（风花的温柔，不只是外表看起来的那样……这份包容力，一定能俘获许多人的心！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
